# CLAUDE.md - Core Project Hub

Welcome to the DNA Music ERP Mini-App repository. This project is a monorepo split into a NestJS backend and a React frontend.

## Repository Structure & Context Maps

- `api/` → Backend service (NestJS + TypeScript + Prisma + PostgreSQL)
- `web/` → Frontend application (React + TypeScript)
- `.cursor/rules/` → Granular AI prompt instructions and constraints

## Current Backend State

| Area                                       | Status  |
| ------------------------------------------ | ------- |
| Prisma schema (User, Headquarter, Student) | Done    |
| Users CRUD (`/api/users`)                  | Done    |
| Auth: login + JWT guard (`/api/auth`)      | Done    |
| Role-based guards (`@Roles`, `RolesGuard`) | Planned |
| Headquarters, Students, Stats modules      | Planned |
| React frontend                             | Planned |

### Auth decisions

- **Login** — `POST /api/auth/login` (public). Returns JWT + user profile.
- **No public register** — users are provisioned by ADMIN via `POST /api/users`.
- **Global guard** — `JwtAuthGuard` protects all routes unless marked `@Public()`.
- **Security** — generic login errors, bcrypt (12 rounds), dummy hash on unknown email.

